+model and can estimate additional degradation introduced by the actual
+historical-object capture, for example cover glass or a small focus mismatch.
+The exact split between extra sigma and extra defocus remains secondary to the
+resulting carrier MTF.
+
+For coupled BW fits, leave-one-out validation freezes the joint defocus/compact
+blur coordinate and refits the monotone residual sigma on each retained subset.
+The resulting process-screen MTF span and maximum displacement measure whether
+the colour-recovery transfer itself is stable without repeatedly choosing a new
+physical decomposition.
 
 ## Qt workflow
 
